          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Múk tlahhoó Laáwi oo baraá tla/angwhúng i dirií' mu gunqareesara', asma inooín gár ta kon i káhh, laqaá gár i aaliya' i káhh dír tla/angwhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee umuú kurkú tame ilahhooár gár wák baraá muruú mibaango ar balangwhúng ka hanisá' sleémeero, nee ka batsá' baraá gixsaduhúng sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí daqaní an oo múk tlahhoó Laáwi, asma inooín gár ta kon i káhh, laqaá aalír ta kon baraá tla/angwhunge i káhh, sleeme ar dahaaye nee panaay, nee /ameenár kwaeeli, tidá' hoot baraá gixsarhúng wa aleeró. Kuká' sleémeero ni hardihiye' as niwa /aymár aya' niri aaxiyá'. Adoorí tleehhaak, daqaní AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng nu tsuuq baraá gadiyérhúng sleémeero ar taqo tlehhita'a dabaahunge.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
